---
import InternalLayout from '@/layouts/InternalLayout.astro';
---

<InternalLayout
  title="Iconography"
  description="The Lucide pack, the sizes it is used at, and when an icon needs a text label."
  section="brand"
  subsection="brand-iconography"
>
  <div class="space-y-10">
    <p class="text-base text-cabuya-text-secondary max-w-3xl">
      Cabuya standardises on the
      <a href="https://lucide.dev/" class="text-cabuya-primary underline underline-offset-2">Lucide</a>
      pack via <code>@lucide/astro</code>: consistent geometry, ISC licensed,
      tree-shakeable, and no runtime cost in an Astro island.
    </p>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cabuya-text">Sizes</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-cabuya-border">
        <table class="min-w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-cabuya-bg-brand/60 dark:bg-cabuya-bg-brand">
            <tr class="text-left">
              <th class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-cabuya-text">Size</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-cabuya-text">Pixel</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-cabuya-text">Use</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-cabuya-border">
            <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">sm</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">16px</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-cabuya-text-secondary">Inline meta · table cells · compact UI</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">md</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">20px</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-cabuya-text-secondary">Buttons · inline links · headers</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">lg</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">24px</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-cabuya-text-secondary">Default — most UI</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">xl</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">32px</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-cabuya-text-secondary">Hero / feature panels · empty-state illustrations</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cabuya-text">Stroke width</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-cabuya-text-secondary space-y-1">
        <li><code>1.5</code> — default. Quiet, editorial.</li>
        <li><code>2</code> — emphasis. Use sparingly (CTAs, alerts).</li>
        <li>Never below <code>1.25</code> — poor legibility on dark mode.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cabuya-text">Color</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-cabuya-text-secondary space-y-1">
        <li>Use <code>currentColor</code> by default — inherits the surrounding text token.</li>
        <li>Decorative-only icons can use <code>--cabuya-accent</code> if accompanied by visible text.</li>
        <li>Never use <code>--cabuya-accent</code> as the only visual signal of meaning (color alone fails accessibility).</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cabuya-text">Accessibility</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-cabuya-text-secondary space-y-1">
        <li>Decorative icons next to visible text: <code>aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;</code>.</li>
        <li>Icon-only buttons / links: <code>aria-label</code> is mandatory and localized via <code>getTranslations(lang)</code>.</li>
        <li>Status icons (success/warning/error) must include a screen-reader label, not just color.</li>
        <li>Touch target minimum: <strong>44×44px</strong> (icon size + padding).</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cabuya-text">Astro / Svelte usage</h2>
      <pre class="rounded-lg bg-cabuya-bg-brand/60 dark:bg-cabuya-bg-brand p-4 overflow-x-auto text-xs text-cabuya-text"><code>{`---
// Astro: import only the icons you use; tree-shaking strips the rest.
import { Calendar, Mic, Users } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<button class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-md bg-cabuya-fill text-cabuya-on-fill">
  <ShieldCheck size={20} aria-hidden="true" stroke-width={1.5} />
  <span>Validate a feed</span>
</button>

<a href="/registry" aria-label="Open the registry" class="p-2 rounded-md hover:bg-cabuya-primary-soft">
  <BookOpen size={20} aria-hidden="true" stroke-width={1.5} />
</a>`}</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cabuya-text">Reserved icons (community lexicon)</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-cabuya-text-secondary">
        Pin one icon per concept site-wide so users build mental shortcuts:
      </p>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-cabuya-text">
        <div class="rounded-md border border-cabuya-border p-3"><code>ShieldCheck</code> — conformance, a measured level</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-cabuya-border p-3"><code>FileJson</code> — a feed, a manifest, a schema</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-cabuya-border p-3"><code>MapPin</code> — a place record</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-cabuya-border p-3"><code>Radio</code> — a transport, a live probe</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-cabuya-border p-3"><code>BookOpen</code> — the specification, the registry</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-cabuya-border p-3"><code>Users</code> — publishers, the working group</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-cabuya-border p-3"><code>Terminal</code> — the CLI and the skill</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-cabuya-border p-3"><code>Globe</code> — language and locale (the header switcher); adoption beyond one city</div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-cabuya-text-muted">
        One icon per concept, site-wide. A reader who learns that the shield
        means &ldquo;measured&rdquo; should never meet it standing for something else.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cabuya-text">Don't</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-cabuya-text-secondary space-y-1">
        <li>Mix icon packs (no Heroicons, Material, or Phosphor — Lucide only).</li>
        <li>Use emoji as functional icons in chrome (only allowed in user-generated content).</li>
        <li>Apply drop shadows or gradients to icons.</li>
        <li>Animate icons by default — opt-in only and respect <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</InternalLayout>
